  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Seamlessly Integrate Geographic Services with Camunda and Google Maps",
    "splashDescription": "The Camunda Google Maps Connector offers a powerful integration that brings Google Maps' rich geographic services into your Camunda workflows. From validating customer addresses to calculating shipping distances, this connector enables you to automate key geolocation tasks within your business processes.",
